OL,3,GNEWSALifeguard cover reduced as summer
OL,4,Aseason ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeachgoers are being reminded that
OL,7,Flifeguard patrol times are set to
OL,8,Fchange as the summer season ends.
OL,10,FThe RNLI said patrols would change at
OL,11,Fbeaches across Devon, Cornwall and
OL,12,FJersey in the coming weeks, with some
OL,13,Fsites moving to weekend-only cover, and
OL,14,Fencouraged anyone visiting the coast to
OL,15,Fchoose a lifeguarded beach and check
OL,16,Fthe conditions before heading into the
OL,17,Fwater.
OL,19,FRNLI regional lifeguard lead Henry
OL,20,FSaddler-Irvine thanked lifeguards and
OL,21,Fsupport teams for their work during
OL,22,Fwhat he described as a busy summer.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
