OL,3,GNEWSALifeguard cover reduced as summer
OL,4,Aseason ends
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They have demonstrated
OL,7,Fprofessionalism, resilience and
OL,8,Fteamwork every day, often in
OL,9,Fchallenging conditions, to help keep
OL,10,Fpeople safe along our coastline," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
